### Variables
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1

POST {{baseUrl}}/authors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Robert C. Martin",
  "bio": "Uncle Bob",
  "country": "USA",
  "birth_year": 1952
}

# 1. HAPPY CASES (Expected: 201 Created)


### 1.1 Happy Case - Create Book with existing author_id
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Code",
  "year": 2008,
  "summary": "A handbook of agile software craftsmanship",
  "author_id": 1
}

### 1.2 Happy Case - Create Book with author_id = null
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Refactoring",
  "year": 1999,
  "summary": "Improving the Design of Existing Code",
  "author_id": null
}



# 2. VALIDATION CASES (Expected: 422 Unprocessable Entity)


### 2.1 Missing title
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 2008
}

### 2.2 Missing year
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Code"
}

### 2.3 Empty title
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "year": 2008
}

### 2.4 Title too long (> 200 characters)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat.",
  "year": 2008
}

### 2.5 Year too small (< 1000)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Code",
  "year": 999
}

### 2.6 Year too large (> 2100)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Code",
  "year": 2101
}

### 2.7 Invalid year data type
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Code",
  "year": "abc"
}

### 2.8 Summary too long (> 500 characters)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Code",
  "year": 2008,
  "summary": "Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat. Duis aute irure dolor in reprehenderit in voluptate velit esse cillum dolore eu fugiat nulla pariatur. Excepteur sint occaecat cupidatat non proident, sunt in culpa qui officia deserunt mollit anim id est laborum. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit."
}


### 3.1 Non-existent author_id (Expected: 404 Not Found)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Code",
  "year": 2008,
  "author_id": 9999
}

### 3.2 List all books (Expected: 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books

### 3.3 Get book details by ID (Expected: 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/1

### 3.4 Get book by non-existent ID (Expected: 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/9999

### 3.5 Update book (Expected: 200 OK)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Code - Updated",
  "year": 2009,
  "summary": "Updated summary",
  "author_id": 1
}

### 3.6 List books by author ID (Expected: 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/authors/1/books

### 3.7 List books by non-existent author ID (Expected: 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/authors/9999/books

### 3.8 Delete book (Expected: 204 No Content)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/books/1